WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.110 --> 00:00:00.943
- Hey, y'all!

00:00:00.943 --> 00:00:03.020
I'm Mason Ramsey and I'm here at Buzzfeed

00:00:03.020 --> 00:00:06.793
to answer some fan questions. (yodels)

00:00:09.570 --> 00:00:12.237
(country music)

00:00:15.045 --> 00:00:20.045
I don't know, I just did it. (yodels)

00:00:26.768 --> 00:00:29.920
No one told me this, that I
was gonna be at Coachella.

00:00:29.920 --> 00:00:32.937
And so I was like, "Where's Coachella at?"

00:00:32.980 --> 00:00:35.073
And I didn't really know, so.

00:00:35.080 --> 00:00:38.500
It's a big thing.

00:00:38.500 --> 00:00:43.070
I'm the first youngest
person in country music

00:00:43.070 --> 00:00:44.913
to sing at Coachella.

00:00:48.907 --> 00:00:51.097
I just woke up one day.

00:00:52.880 --> 00:00:55.340
Got the call from Ellen, she wanted me

00:00:55.660 --> 00:00:58.140
and I went there and that's how I got

00:00:58.140 --> 00:01:01.823
my booster seat, kind of like.

00:01:02.356 --> 00:01:05.033
Alrighty, let's mix and match here.

00:01:10.700 --> 00:01:12.950
I'd have to go with
Blake Shelton on that one

00:01:13.210 --> 00:01:14.253
'cause he's fun.

00:01:14.510 --> 00:01:15.343
Okie dok.

00:01:21.320 --> 00:01:22.523
Well, I got a great one.

00:01:22.710 --> 00:01:24.330
If there was a zombie apocalypse,

00:01:24.330 --> 00:01:25.780
I would use my yodeling to kill

00:01:25.780 --> 00:01:28.777
every single one of 'em. (yodels)

00:01:31.420 --> 00:01:34.087
It'd be like wind blowing trees.

00:01:39.720 --> 00:01:40.770
Hmm, that's a good one.

00:01:40.770 --> 00:01:43.323
DJ Suede is my best bro, so.

00:01:43.820 --> 00:01:45.433
He helped me out a lot, so.

00:01:46.440 --> 00:01:50.553
I'm gonna say I feel good
and thank you, DJ Suede.

00:01:54.220 --> 00:01:56.490
So one day, I was playing Minecraft

00:01:57.180 --> 00:01:59.570
and there was this person on Minecraft.

00:01:59.570 --> 00:02:02.030
And my cousin was playing online.

00:02:02.030 --> 00:02:05.027
My cousin asked, "Are you
a big fan of Mason Ramsey?"

00:02:05.240 --> 00:02:08.617
And she's like, "No, I think I'll pass."

00:02:09.358 --> 00:02:10.290
Was like, "What?"

00:02:11.290 --> 00:02:15.593
Haters are haters and people
who like you, they help.

00:02:15.969 --> 00:02:19.219
(heavenly music plays)

00:02:24.370 --> 00:02:28.143
My EP has very new songs.

00:02:28.600 --> 00:02:31.560
My single released Famous, Yo Da Lady Who.

00:02:31.560 --> 00:02:34.680
If you listen to that,
that song's on my EP too.

00:02:34.680 --> 00:02:36.403
That one is a killer.

00:02:36.920 --> 00:02:38.320
That's a bop, bop.

00:02:38.320 --> 00:02:40.093
Like, it's a line dancing song.

00:02:44.669 --> 00:02:45.502
I just sing.

00:02:45.502 --> 00:02:47.080
I'm a singer who likes to sing.

00:02:47.080 --> 00:02:51.863
So if I find something
that I do, it's to sing.

00:02:57.123 --> 00:02:58.713
Ooh, I know what I would be.

00:02:58.720 --> 00:03:02.763
I would be a basketball
player, play at Duke,

00:03:03.010 --> 00:03:04.440
then go to Golden State Warriors,

00:03:04.440 --> 00:03:07.363
play with Kevin Durant,
Steph Curry, Draymond Green.

00:03:07.370 --> 00:03:10.153
By the way, Kevin Durant
left OKC so I'm sorry.

00:03:10.380 --> 00:03:11.213
Oh, Thunder.

00:03:11.370 --> 00:03:13.063
I'm sorry Thunder for everything.

00:03:13.260 --> 00:03:16.383
I know, I loved KD when
he was on the Thunder.

00:03:16.560 --> 00:03:18.420
But now is time.

00:03:18.420 --> 00:03:21.033
I loved the Thunder, Coach Billy Donovan,

00:03:21.720 --> 00:03:23.673
but now it's Coach Steve Kerr.

00:03:30.484 --> 00:03:32.067
I would say Famous,

00:03:34.660 --> 00:03:37.273
but for all the people who
like famous, I'm sorry.

00:03:37.770 --> 00:03:41.400
I gotta let you down,
I like The Way I See It

00:03:41.400 --> 00:03:42.900
and I know there's a couple out there

00:03:42.900 --> 00:03:44.200
who like The Way I See It.

00:03:44.310 --> 00:03:46.253
'Cause that's the only way I see it.

00:03:46.410 --> 00:03:47.410
Thanks Buzzfeed.

00:03:47.410 --> 00:03:50.833
I had fun and thank you
fans for all your questions.

00:03:50.862 --> 00:03:52.945
(yodels)

00:03:56.410 --> 00:03:59.293
Goodbye, see you next time on Buzzfeed.

00:03:59.575 --> 00:04:02.242
(country music)

